stateDiagram-v2
state Link {
 state Session {
  [*] --> Active
  Active --> Retired: Retire session
 }
 --
 state View {
  [*] --> Opening
  Opening --> Review: Resolve exact draft
  Opening --> Unavailable: Refuse or fail read
  Unavailable --> Opening: Reload manually
  Review --> Unavailable: Refuse submission [when Active, Submitting]
  %% when Active, Submitting
  Opening --> Closed: Retire session
  Review --> Closed: Retire session
  Unavailable --> Closed: Retire session
  Opening --> Closed: Close view
  Review --> Closed: Close view
  Unavailable --> Closed: Close view
 }
 --
 state Operation {
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Submitting: Submit exact intent [when Active, Review]
  %% when Active, Review
  Submitting --> Unconfirmed: Lose or mismatch receipt [when Active, Review]
  %% when Active, Review
  Unconfirmed --> Submitting: Retry same intent [when Active, Review]
  %% when Active, Review
  Submitting --> Confirmed: Match receipt [when Active, Review]
  %% when Active, Review
  Submitting --> Idle: Refuse submission [when Active, Review]
  %% when Active, Review
  Idle --> Idle: Retire session
  Submitting --> Idle: Retire session
  Unconfirmed --> Idle: Retire session
  Confirmed --> Idle: Retire session
  Idle --> Idle: Close view
  Submitting --> Idle: Close view
  Unconfirmed --> Idle: Close view
  Confirmed --> Idle: Close view
 }
}
%% never NoRetiredReview: Retired & Review -- Retired sessions expose no private review.
%% never NoRetiredWrite: Retired & Submitting -- Retired sessions cannot write.
%% never NoLateRevival: Retired & Unconfirmed -- Late results cannot revive a retired view.
%% never NoClosedWrite: Closed & Submitting -- Closing aborts owned requests.
%% Payload invariants exercised through the parser and request seam in action-link.test.mjs:
%% Displayed identity equals issued identity. Write identity, version, text and recipients equal review.
%% One intent uses one key. Replay or expiry never authorizes another effect.
